<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 10 discount T-bill issues Apr 7-11.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 10 discount T-bill issues Apr 7-11.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 10 issues of discount T-bills with no par value or minimum acceptable price set in advance at auctions this week, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Half of the issues have a maturity of one week and the rest have a four-week maturity. Auction dates and issue dates for each issue overlap.</p>
<p>Details of the issues follow:</p>
<p> ISSUE NUMBER	    ISSUE DATE	 MATURITY DATE</p>
<p> BG3026097009	    April 7	    April 14</p>
<p> BG3026197007	    April 7	    May 5</p>
<p> BG3026297005	    April 8	    April 15</p>
<p> BG3026397003	    April 8	    May 6</p>
<p> BG3026497001	    April 9	    April 16</p>
<p> BG3026597008	    April 9	    May 7</p>
<p> BG3026697006	    April 10	   April 17</p>
<p> BG3026797004	    April 10	   May 8</p>
<p> BG3026897002	    April 11	   April 18</p>
<p> BG3026997000	    April 11	   May 9</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
